# @hub-lanes

# ── LEAD REVIEW PROMOTION (BH-1951) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# bin/lead-review-land.sh — every 15 min (a backstop: a finished lead review
# rings this lane through the wakes doorbell, BH-5317), promote each `done` lead review
# request (bin/lead-review.sh on the boxes wrote it) into a source=lead row in
# /api/verdicts, then stamp the request promoted. The same tick writes ONE
# ALERTS line per overdue (LEAD_REVIEW_OVERDUE_MIN) or failed request. No agent
# call, no SSH. Off via flags/lane-off-lead-review-land. Log:
# logs/lead-review-land.log.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/lead-review-land.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
